<Properties><string name="Name">REYZN PIANO</string><bool name="Disabled">false</bool><ProtectedString name="Source"><![CDATA[--[=[
REYZN UNIVERSAL AUTO PIANO V1
REYZN PIANO · Reproductor local para experiencias Roblox que publican controles de piano.

INSTALACIÓN
En Roblox Studio abre StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts. Inserta desde archivo
REYZN_PIANO_V1/REYZN_PIANO.rbxmx en esa carpeta y pulsa Play (F5).
También puedes pegar este archivo completo en un LocalScript de esa carpeta.
La ventana abre con Für Elise. Espera el indicador verde, pulsa Tocar y abre
Pianos para tocar a mano. A W S E D F T G Y H U J K cubren C4–C5 en esa pestaña.
Arrastra el encabezado para mover, la esquina inferior derecha para redimensionar
y el botón − del encabezado para minimizar. La × cierra y libera el reproductor.

SONIDO
La demo es un piano polifónico local de 12 voces. Usa la muestra «piano note c4»
de I_AmKota, activo 78413131279275. La disponibilidad y los permisos dependen
de Roblox. Si la carga falla, Pianos muestra el motivo. Como alternativa, importa
la muestra original incluida REYZN_C4.wav en el gestor de recursos, da permiso
de uso a tu experiencia y asigna el ID como atributo de texto PianoSampleId del
LocalScript. PianoSampleRoot admite una nota MIDI o C4 (predeterminada).
No se necesita un servidor HTTP. El modelo contiene el código y las partituras.

INTEGRAR UN INSTRUMENTO
El detector descubre raíces con la etiqueta ReyznPiano en Workspace o PlayerGui,
hijos de carpetas ReyznPianos de esos dos servicios y raíces directas que anuncian
su interfaz mediante atributos. En Pianos, pulsa el nombre para cambiar entre
candidatos. Para otro instrumento, introduce su ruta exacta, por ejemplo
Workspace/Escenario/Gran piano. Al quitar el piano seleccionado se detiene la música.

El creador conecta NoteOn y NoteOff a SU motor de audio en el cliente. Son
BindableEvent locales. Tras conectar ambos, establece PianoReady=true. Usa el
atributo entero MaxVoices para anunciar polifonía (predeterminado 1) y el texto
InstrumentName para mostrar el nombre. Un solo puerto debe aceptar notas de
este reproductor y liberarlas incluso tras cambios de interfaz. Si el piano
comparte voces con otras fuentes debe distinguirlas en su propio controlador.

  ReyznAdapter   Controles publicados y argumentos de los eventos
  Midi           NoteOn(nota MIDI, intensidad 0–1), NoteOff(nota MIDI) en la
                 raíz. Atributos enteros MinNote y MaxNote, ambos inclusivos.
  Keyboard       Mismos eventos en la raíz. El primer argumento es un token de
                 texto. Keys contiene StringValue con Value=token (o su Name),
                 y atributo numérico MidiNote en cada tecla.
  GuiKeys        Keys contiene GuiButton. Cada botón contiene sus propios
                 NoteOn(intensidad) y NoteOff(). MidiNote, el nombre o el texto
                 del botón indica la altura, por ejemplo F#4.

Ejemplo de conexión con tu controlador dentro de un LocalScript del instrumento:
    root.NoteOn.Event:Connect(function(n,v) instrument:press(n,v) end)
    root.NoteOff.Event:Connect(function(n) instrument:release(n) end)
    root:SetAttribute("ReyznAdapter","Midi")
    root:SetAttribute("MinNote",36)
    root:SetAttribute("MaxNote",84)
    root:SetAttribute("MaxVoices",8)
    root:SetAttribute("PianoReady",true)
    game:GetService("CollectionService"):AddTag(root,"ReyznPiano")
Aquí root e instrument son la raíz y el controlador de TU piano. Para adaptar
tokens o botones sin alturas, usa A=C4, S=D4 en la calibración. Enviar el
campo vacío restaura el mapa publicado. Las notas ausentes se pliegan por octava.
Una clase de altura sin ninguna tecla disponible se omite. Los pianos
monofónicos conservan la línea superior de un acorde.

BIBLIOTECA Y CRÉDITOS
200 piezas. Las diez primeras son siete arreglos breves de temas históricos y
tres miniaturas originales de este proyecto. Las otras 190 son reducciones para
piano de canciones de OpenScore Lieder Corpus (CC0). Combinan la línea vocal,
bajos y notas interiores del acompañamiento, en una pasada de la estrofa. Los
temas abreviados se identifican en el título. En las ediciones sin indicación
de tempo se adoptaron 80 BPM. Las dificultades y categorías son editoriales.
Cada ID lcNNNN identifica la edición en https://musescore.com/score/NNNN .
Partituras fuente: https://github.com/OpenScore/Lieder/tree/38c5db510224d9facdc4b08d741fc788cfb58ea8
Licencia de esas transcripciones: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
El audio de demostración se referencia en Roblox. El WAV alternativo fue sintetizado para este proyecto.

IMPORTAR MIDI
En PC o Android, usa la pestaña MIDI y pega Base64 de un archivo autorizado. Para
obtener el texto en un equipo con Python:
    python -m base64 -e pieza.mid > pieza.b64.txt
Para abrir archivos directamente en Studio, pega esta misma fuente en un Script
y guárdalo como complemento local («Save as Local Plugin»). El botón «Importar MIDI»
abre el selector y guarda los datos en ReplicatedStorage/ReyznPianoMIDI. Al guardar
el lugar, esas piezas quedan disponibles para sus jugadores. El complemento actúa
en Studio y el LocalScript actúa en el juego.
SMF 0/1 con PPQ, tempo global, acordes, pedal CC64 y velocidad. Se excluyen
percusión (canal 10), SMPTE y SMF 2. Tope por archivo de 1 MiB, 24 000 notas y dos horas.
El importador de sesión admite 32 archivos y 4 MiB de datos. Favoritos, calibración,
cola y ajustes son locales. Los favoritos y ajustes duran hasta que sales de la sesión.

ARQUITECTURA Y PRUEBAS
Busca MIDIParser, SongLibrary, NoteMapper, PlaybackScheduler, AutoPlayer, PianoAdapter,
PianoDetector, DemoPiano, SettingsManager, InterfaceController y SelfTest en este archivo.
Se descomprime un grupo de partituras bajo demanda. El reloj musical usa tiempo
absoluto y un Heartbeat conectado durante la reproducción. La precisión física
depende del fotograma, el dispositivo de audio y el adaptador. Un ataque que empieza
y termina entre dos fotogramas puede quedar fuera. La demo se escucha en el cliente.

Activa el atributo booleano RunPianoTests del LocalScript y pulsa Play para ejecutar
la suite y ver el resultado en Output. Para comprobar audio y gestos en tu equipo:
1. Toca la primera pieza en la demo, pausa en una nota larga, reanuda y pulsa Stop.
2. En Pianos toca un acorde y prueba la velocidad 0.25× y 3×. Cambia de instrumento.
3. Abre Favoritos y la cola, gira el emulador móvil, ajusta el tamaño y cierra.
4. Importa un MIDI propio con cambios de tempo y comprueba su duración.
]=]

local PackedScores, CatalogComposers, CatalogRows

-- MIDIParser · SMF 0/1. Merge tracks before applying global tempo or per-channel pedal.
local MIDIParser = {}
function MIDIParser.parse(bytes)
    assert(type(bytes) == "string" and #bytes <= 1048576, "El MIDI supera 1 MiB")
    local pos, boundary = 1, #bytes
    local function take(count)
        assert(count >= 0 and pos + count - 1 <= boundary, "MIDI truncado")
        local first = pos
        pos += count
        return first
    end
    local function byte() return string.byte(bytes, take(1)) end
    local function uint(count)
        local n = 0
        for _ = 1, count do n = n * 256 + byte() end
        return n
    end
    local function tag()
        local at = take(4)
        return bytes:sub(at, at + 3)
    end
    local function vlq()
        local n = 0
        for _ = 1, 4 do
            local b = byte()
            n = n * 128 + b % 128
            if b < 128 then return n end
        end
        error("Cantidad MIDI de longitud variable inválida")
    end
    assert(tag() == "MThd", "Falta la cabecera MThd")
    local size = uint(4)
    assert(size >= 6, "Cabecera SMF corta")
    local format, tracks, ppq = uint(2), uint(2), uint(2)
    assert((format == 0 and tracks == 1) or (format == 1 and tracks >= 1 and tracks <= 128), "Usa SMF 0 o 1, hasta 128 pistas")
    assert(ppq > 0 and ppq < 32768, "Se requiere tiempo musical PPQ")
    take(size - 6)
    local events, total, lastTick = {}, 0, 0
    local function emit(tick, kind, channel, a, b)
        events[#events + 1] = {tick, #events + 1, kind, channel, a, b}
    end
    for _ = 1, tracks do
        assert(tag() == "MTrk", "Falta una pista MTrk")
        local length = uint(4)
        boundary = pos + length - 1
        assert(boundary <= #bytes, "Pista MIDI incompleta")
        local tick, running, ended = 0, nil, false
        while pos <= boundary do
            total += 1
            assert(total <= 120000, "Demasiados eventos MIDI")
            tick += vlq()
            local b = string.byte(bytes, pos)
            assert(b, "Falta el estado MIDI")
            local status = running
            if b >= 128 then status = byte() end
            assert(status, "Running status sin evento previo")
            if status == 255 then
                running = nil
                local meta, len = byte(), vlq()
                if meta == 81 then
                    assert(len == 3, "Tempo MIDI inválido")
                    local us = uint(3)
                    assert(us > 0, "Tempo MIDI nulo")
                    emit(tick, "tempo", 0, us)
                elseif meta == 47 then
                    assert(len == 0, "Fin de pista inválido")
                    ended = true
                    pos = boundary + 1
                else
                    take(len)
                end
            elseif status == 240 or status == 247 then
                running = nil
                take(vlq())
            else
                assert(status >= 128 and status < 240, "Estado MIDI no admitido")
                running = status
                local kind, ch = math.floor(status / 16), status % 16
                local a = byte()
                local v = 0
                if kind ~= 12 and kind ~= 13 then v = byte() end
                assert(a < 128 and v < 128, "Dato de canal inválido")
                if ch ~= 9 then
                    if kind == 9 and v > 0 then emit(tick, "on", ch, a, v)
                    elseif kind == 8 or kind == 9 then emit(tick, "off", ch, a)
                    elseif kind == 11 and (a == 64 or a == 120 or a == 123 or a == 121) then emit(tick, "cc", ch, a, v) end
                end
            end
        end
        assert(ended, "Falta el final de pista")
        lastTick = math.max(lastTick, tick)
        boundary = #bytes
    end
    table.sort(events, function(a,b)
        if a[1] == b[1] then return a[2] < b[2] end
        return a[1] < b[1]
    end)
    local notes, tempos = {}, {{time=0, bpm=120}}
    local keys, pedal, ringing = {}, {}, {}
    local seconds, tick, usec = 0, 0, 500000
    local function releasePedal(ch)
        for _, note in ipairs(ringing[ch] or {}) do note.finish = seconds end
        ringing[ch] = nil
    end
    local function finish(ch, note)
        if pedal[ch] then
            if not ringing[ch] then ringing[ch] = {} end
            table.insert(ringing[ch], note)
        else note.finish = seconds end
    end
    for _, ev in ipairs(events) do
        seconds += (ev[1] - tick) * usec / (1000000 * ppq)
        assert(seconds <= 7200, "La duración máxima es de dos horas")
        tick = ev[1]
        local kind, ch, p, v = ev[3], ev[4], ev[5], ev[6]
        if kind == "tempo" then
            usec = p
            if tempos[#tempos].time == seconds then tempos[#tempos].bpm = 60000000 / usec
            else table.insert(tempos, {time=seconds, bpm=60000000/usec}) end
        elseif kind == "on" then
            assert(#notes < 24000, "Máximo de 24 000 notas por MIDI")
            local note = {start=seconds, pitch=p, velocity=v, id=#notes + 1}
            table.insert(notes, note)
            local key = ch * 128 + p
            local list = keys[key]
            if not list then list = {first=1,last=0}; keys[key] = list end
            list.last += 1
            list[list.last] = note
        elseif kind == "off" then
            local key = ch * 128 + p
            local list = keys[key]
            if list then
                finish(ch, list[list.first])
                list[list.first] = nil
                list.first += 1
                if list.first > list.last then keys[key] = nil end
            end
        elseif p == 64 then
            pedal[ch] = v >= 64
            if not pedal[ch] then releasePedal(ch) end
        elseif p == 121 then
            pedal[ch] = false
            releasePedal(ch)
        else
            if p == 120 then pedal[ch] = false; releasePedal(ch) end
            for k = ch*128, ch*128+127 do
                local list = keys[k]
                if list then
                    for j = list.first, list.last do finish(ch, list[j]) end
                    keys[k] = nil
                end
            end
        end
    end
    seconds += (lastTick - tick) * usec / (1000000 * ppq)
    assert(seconds <= 7200, "La duración máxima es de dos horas")
    local clean = {}
    for _, n in ipairs(notes) do
        n.finish = n.finish or seconds
        if n.finish > n.start then table.insert(clean,n) end
    end
    assert(#clean > 0, "El MIDI no contiene notas melódicas con duración")
    return {notes=clean, duration=seconds, tempos=tempos, bpm=tempos[1].bpm}
end

-- Printed scores are stored losslessly as PPQ-48 note lengths, grouped by velocity.
-- Only the current group is inflated. MIDI imports use the SMF reader above.
local function unpackEdition(bytes)
    local pos = 1
    local function read()
        local n=0
        for _=1,4 do
            local b=string.byte(bytes,pos)
            assert(b,"Partitura incompleta")
            pos+=1
            n=n*128+b%128
            if b<128 then return n end
        end
        error("Dato de partitura inválido")
    end
    local endTick,changes=read(),read()
    local tempos={}
    for i=1,changes do
        local tick,bpm=read(),read()/100
        local last=tempos[i-1]
        local time=if last then last.time+(tick-last.tick)*60/(48*last.bpm) else 0
        tempos[i]={tick=tick,bpm=bpm,time=time}
    end
    local function seconds(tick)
        local lo,hi=1,#tempos
        while lo<hi do
            local mid=math.ceil((lo+hi)/2)
            if tempos[mid].tick<=tick then lo=mid else hi=mid-1 end
        end
        local m=tempos[lo]
        return m.time+(tick-m.tick)*60/(48*m.bpm)
    end
    local count, lanes=read(),read()
    local notes=table.create(count)
    for _=1,lanes do
        local velocity,n=read(),read()
        local group=table.create(n)
        local tick=0
        for i=1,n do tick+=read();group[i]={start=tick,velocity=velocity} end
        for _,v in ipairs(group) do v.finish=seconds(v.start+read());v.start=seconds(v.start) end
        for _,v in ipairs(group) do
            v.pitch=string.byte(bytes,pos);pos+=1
            v.id=#notes+1
            table.insert(notes,v)
        end
    end
    assert(#notes==count and pos==#bytes+1,"Longitud de partitura inválida")
    table.sort(notes,function(a,b)
        if a.start==b.start then return a.pitch<b.pitch end
        return a.start<b.start
    end)
    return {notes=notes, duration=seconds(endTick), tempos=tempos, bpm=tempos[1].bpm}
end

local SongLibrary = {}
SongLibrary.__index = SongLibrary
local Categories = {"Classical","Romantic","Emotional","Fast Piano","Relaxing","Cinematic"}
local Levels = {"Inicial","Intermedia","Avanzada"}
function SongLibrary.new(decodeGroup)
    local self = setmetatable({all={}, byId={}, decodeGroup=decodeGroup, imported=0, importBytes=0}, SongLibrary)
    for _, r in ipairs(CatalogRows) do
        local s = {id=r[1], title=r[2], composer=CatalogComposers[r[3]], category=Categories[r[4]], level=Levels[r[5]], bpm=r[6], duration=r[7], row=r}
        self.byId[s.id] = s
        table.insert(self.all,s)
    end
    return self
end
function SongLibrary:score(song)
    if self.cachedSong == song then return self.cachedScore end
    local bytes = song.bytes
    if not bytes then
        local r = song.row
        if self.group ~= r[8] then
            self.raw = self.decodeGroup(PackedScores[r[8]])
            self.group = r[8]
        end
        bytes = self.raw:sub(r[9],r[9]+r[10]-1)
    end
    local score = if song.row then unpackEdition(bytes) else MIDIParser.parse(bytes)
    self.cachedSong,self.cachedScore = song,score
    return score
end
function SongLibrary:import(title, bytes)
    assert(#self.all < #CatalogRows+32 and self.importBytes+#bytes <= 4194304, "Límite de importación de sesión alcanzado")
    local score = MIDIParser.parse(bytes)
    self.imported += 1
    local s = {id="import"..self.imported, title=title, composer="MIDI importado", category="MIDI", level=Levels[math.clamp(math.ceil(#score.notes / math.max(1,score.duration) / 2.5),1,3)], bpm=score.bpm, duration=score.duration, bytes=bytes}
    self.importBytes += #bytes
    self.byId[s.id] = s
    table.insert(self.all,s)
    self.cachedSong,self.cachedScore=s,score
    return s
end

-- NoteMapper · prefer a common octave shift; fold individual outliers by octaves.
local NoteMapper = {}
function NoteMapper.build(score, keys, octave, auto)
    local weights={}
    for _,n in ipairs(score.notes) do weights[n.pitch]=(weights[n.pitch] or 0)+1 end
    local shift,best=0,-math.huge
    if auto then
        for s=-10,10 do
            local rank=-math.abs(s)*0.01
            for p,w in pairs(weights) do if keys[p+12*s] then rank+=w end end
            if rank>best then shift,best=s,rank end
        end
    end
    local map={}
    for pitch in pairs(weights) do
        local want=pitch+(shift+octave)*12
        if keys[want] then map[pitch]=want
        else
            local nearest,distance=nil,math.huge
            for p in pairs(keys) do
                local d=math.abs(p-want)
                if (p-want)%12==0 and (d<distance or (d==distance and p<(nearest or 128))) then nearest,distance=p,d end
            end
            map[pitch]=nearest
        end
    end
    return map
end
local function upperBound(array,time,field)
    local lo,hi=1,#array+1
    while lo<hi do
        local mid=math.floor((lo+hi)/2)
        if array[mid][field]<=time then lo=mid+1 else hi=mid end
    end
    return lo
end

-- PlaybackScheduler. One absolute clock and one live frame connection. A stalled
-- frame reconstructs the sounding notes at the current time instead of replaying a burst.
local PlaybackScheduler={}
PlaybackScheduler.__index=PlaybackScheduler
function PlaybackScheduler.new(clock,connectFrame)
    return setmetatable({clock=clock,connectFrame=connectFrame, state="stopped", speed=1, octave=0, auto=true,
        offset=0,active={},sounding={},order={},desired={},revision=0},PlaybackScheduler)
end
function PlaybackScheduler:position()
    if self.state=="playing" then return math.min(self.score.duration,self.offset+(self.clock()-self.anchor)*self.speed) end
    return self.offset
end
function PlaybackScheduler:silence()
    for p in pairs(self.sounding) do pcall(self.port.off,p) end
    table.clear(self.sounding)
    self.revision+=1
end
function PlaybackScheduler:detach()
    if self.frame then self.frame:Disconnect();self.frame=nil end
end
function PlaybackScheduler:stop()
    self:detach()
    self:silence()
    self.state,self.offset="stopped",0
    table.clear(self.active)
end
function PlaybackScheduler:load(score,port)
    self:stop()
    self.score,self.port=score,port
    self.map=NoteMapper.build(score,port.keys,self.octave,self.auto)
    self.events,self.maxEnds={},{}
    local longest=0
    for i,n in ipairs(score.notes) do
        self.events[#self.events+1]={n.start,true,n}
        self.events[#self.events+1]={n.finish,false,n}
        longest=math.max(longest,n.finish)
        self.maxEnds[i]={longest}
    end
    table.sort(self.events,function(a,b)
        if a[1]~=b[1] then return a[1]<b[1] end
        if a[2]~=b[2] then return b[2] end
        return a[3].id<b[3].id
    end)
    self.cursor=1
end
function PlaybackScheduler:rebuild(t)
    table.clear(self.active)
    local notes=self.score.notes
    local first=upperBound(self.maxEnds,t,1)
    local last=upperBound(notes,t,"start")-1
    for i=first,last do
        local n=notes[i]
        if n.finish>t then self.active[n.id]=n end
    end
    self.cursor=upperBound(self.events,t,1)
end
function PlaybackScheduler:reconcile()
    local desired,order=self.desired,self.order
    table.clear(desired);table.clear(order)
    for _,n in pairs(self.active) do
        local p=self.map[n.pitch]
        if p then
            local old=desired[p]
            if not old then table.insert(order,p) end
            if not old or n.start>old.start or (n.start==old.start and n.velocity>old.velocity) then desired[p]=n end
        end
    end
    -- Preserve the upper melodic line when a keyboard has fewer physical voices.
    if #order>self.port.voices then
        table.sort(order,function(a,b) return a>b end)
        for i=self.port.voices+1,#order do desired[order[i]]=nil end
    end
    for p,previous in pairs(self.sounding) do
        local nextNote=desired[p]
        if not nextNote or nextNote.start>previous.start then
            self.port.off(p);self.sounding[p]=nil;self.revision+=1
        else
            -- If an overlapping younger unison ends, keep holding the older voice.
            self.sounding[p]=nextNote
        end
    end
    for _,p in ipairs(order) do
        local n=desired[p]
        if n and not self.sounding[p] then
            self.sounding[p]=n
            self.port.on(p,n.velocity/127)
            self.revision+=1
        end
    end
end
function PlaybackScheduler:tick()
    local t=self:position()
    if t>=self.score.duration then
        self:stop()
        if self.onEnd then self.onEnd() end
        return
    end
    if t-self.lastTime>0.15 or t<self.lastTime then
        self:rebuild(t)
        self:reconcile()
    else
        local previous=self.cursor
        while self.cursor<=#self.events and self.events[self.cursor][1]<=t do
            local event=self.events[self.cursor]
            local n=event[3]
            self.active[n.id]=if event[2] then n else nil
            self.cursor+=1
        end
        if previous~=self.cursor then self:reconcile() end
    end
    self.lastTime=t
end
function PlaybackScheduler:guard(fn)
    local ok,err=pcall(fn)
    if not ok then
        self:stop()
        if self.onError then self.onError(tostring(err)) end
    end
    return ok
end
function PlaybackScheduler:resume()
    if not self.score or self.state=="playing" then return end
    if self.offset>=self.score.duration then self.offset=0 end
    self.anchor,self.lastTime,self.state=self.clock(),self.offset,"playing"
    if self:guard(function() self:rebuild(self.offset);self:reconcile() end) then
        self.frame=self.connectFrame(function() self:guard(function() self:tick() end) end)
    end
end
function PlaybackScheduler:pause()
    if self.state~="playing" then return end
    self.offset=self:position()
    self.state="paused"
    self:detach();self:silence()
end
function PlaybackScheduler:seek(t)
    if not self.score then return end
    self.offset=math.clamp(t,0,self.score.duration)
    self.anchor,self.lastTime=self.clock(),self.offset
    if self.state=="playing" then
        self:guard(function() self:rebuild(self.offset);self:reconcile() end)
    end
end
function PlaybackScheduler:setSpeed(speed)
    self.offset,self.anchor=self:position(),self.clock()
    self.speed=math.clamp(speed,0.25,3)
end
function PlaybackScheduler:transpose(octave,auto)
    self.octave,self.auto=octave,auto
    if self.port and self.score then
        self.map=NoteMapper.build(self.score,self.port.keys,octave,auto)
        if self.state=="playing" then self:guard(function() self:reconcile() end) end
    end
end

local AutoPlayer={}
AutoPlayer.__index=AutoPlayer
function AutoPlayer.new(library,scheduler)
    local self=setmetatable({library=library,scheduler=scheduler,queue={},shuffle=false,repeatOne=false},AutoPlayer)
    scheduler.onEnd=function() self:advance(true) end
    scheduler.onError=function(e) self:notify("Error del instrumento · "..e) end
    return self
end
function AutoPlayer:notify(message)
    if self.changed then self.changed(message) end
end
function AutoPlayer:setPort(port)
    self.scheduler:stop()
    self.scheduler.score,self.scheduler.port=nil,nil
    self.port,self.current=port,nil
    self:notify()
end
function AutoPlayer:play(song)
    if not self.port or not self.port.ready then self:notify("Selecciona un piano compatible en Pianos");return false end
    if self.beforePlay then self.beforePlay() end
    local ok,err=pcall(function()
        local score=self.library:score(song)
        self.scheduler:load(score,self.port)
        self.current=song
        self.scheduler:resume()
    end)
    if not ok then self.scheduler:stop();self:notify("Error de reproducción · "..tostring(err));return false end
    self:notify()
    return self.scheduler.state=="playing"
end
function AutoPlayer:enqueue(song)
    if #self.queue>=256 then self:notify("La cola admite 256 pistas");return end
    table.insert(self.queue,song);self:notify("En cola · "..song.title)
end
function AutoPlayer:advance(natural)
    if natural and self.repeatOne and self.current then self:play(self.current);return end
    if #self.queue>0 then
        self:play(table.remove(self.queue,if self.shuffle then math.random(#self.queue) else 1))
    elseif self.shuffle and #self.library.all>1 then
        local all=self.library.all
        local i=math.random(#all-1)
        if all[i]==self.current then i=#all end
        self:play(all[i])
    else self.scheduler:stop();self:notify(if natural then "Fin de la pieza" else "La cola está vacía") end
end

-- PianoAdapter · opt-in local endpoints. No inference from arbitrary remotes or input injection.
local function whole(x,low,high)
    return type(x)=="number" and x==math.floor(x) and x>=low and x<=high
end
local function noteNumber(value)
    if whole(value,0,127) then return value end
    if type(value)~="string" then return nil end
    local numeric=tonumber(value)
    if whole(numeric,0,127) then return numeric end
    local letter,acc,oct=value:match("^([A-Ga-g])([#b]?)(%-?%d+)$")
    if not letter then return nil end
    local names={C=0,D=2,E=4,F=5,G=7,A=9,B=11}
    local n=(tonumber(oct)+1)*12+names[letter:upper()]+(if acc=="#" then 1 elseif acc=="b" then -1 else 0)
    return if whole(n,0,127) then n else nil
end
local PitchNames={"C","C#","D","D#","E","F","F#","G","G#","A","A#","B"}
local function pitchName(p) return PitchNames[p%12+1]..(math.floor(p/12)-1) end
local function disconnect(list)
    for _,c in ipairs(list) do c:Disconnect() end
    table.clear(list)
end
local PianoAdapter={}
local function eventPair(obj)
    local a,b=obj:FindFirstChild("NoteOn"),obj:FindFirstChild("NoteOff")
    if a and b and a:IsA("BindableEvent") and b:IsA("BindableEvent") then return a,b end
    return nil,nil
end
function PianoAdapter.inspect(root,overrides)
    local port={root=root,name=tostring(root:GetAttribute("InstrumentName") or root.Name),ready=false,
        keys={},tokens={},voices=1,kind="Sin interfaz",reason="Hace falta una interfaz de notas publicada"}
    local declared=root:GetAttribute("ReyznAdapter")
    local folder=root:FindFirstChild("Keys")
    local on,off=eventPair(root)
    if not declared then
        if folder and on then declared="Keyboard"
        elseif folder then declared="GuiKeys"
        elseif on then declared="Midi" end
    end
    port.kind=declared or port.kind
    local maxVoices=root:GetAttribute("MaxVoices")
    if maxVoices~=nil and not whole(maxVoices,1,128) then port.reason="MaxVoices debe ser 1–128";return port end
    port.voices=maxVoices or 1
    local seen,pairsByPitch={},{}
    if declared=="Midi" and on then
        local lo,hi=root:GetAttribute("MinNote"),root:GetAttribute("MaxNote")
        if not whole(lo,0,127) or not whole(hi,lo,127) then port.reason="Falta un rango MIDI válido";return port end
        for p=lo,hi do port.keys[p]=true end
        port.on=function(p,v) on:Fire(p,v) end
        port.off=function(p) off:Fire(p) end
    elseif folder and ((declared=="Keyboard" and on) or declared=="GuiKeys") then
        local entries=folder:GetChildren()
        if #entries>256 then port.reason="Máximo de 256 controles por piano";return port end
        for _,k in ipairs(entries) do
            local token=k.Name
            local a,b
            local usable=false
            if declared=="Keyboard" and k:IsA("StringValue") then
                if k.Value~="" then token=k.Value end
                usable=true
            elseif declared=="GuiKeys" and k:IsA("GuiButton") then
                a,b=eventPair(k)
                usable=a~=nil
            end
            if usable then
                if seen[token] then port.reason="Nombre de tecla duplicado · "..token;return port end
                seen[token]=true
                local manual=overrides and overrides[token]
                local p=manual or noteNumber(k:GetAttribute("MidiNote")) or noteNumber(k.Name)
                if not p and k:IsA("TextButton") then p=noteNumber(k.Text) end
                if not p and declared=="Keyboard" then p=noteNumber(token) end
                port.tokens[token]=p or false
                if p then
                    if port.keys[p] then port.reason="Dos controles comparten "..pitchName(p)..". Calibra el mapa";return port end
                    port.keys[p]=token
                    pairsByPitch[p]={a,b}
                end
            end
        end
        if declared=="Keyboard" then
            port.on=function(p,v) on:Fire(port.keys[p],v) end
            port.off=function(p) off:Fire(port.keys[p]) end
        else
            port.on=function(p,v) pairsByPitch[p][1]:Fire(v) end
            port.off=function(p) pairsByPitch[p][2]:Fire() end
        end
    else return port end
    port.low,port.high=128,-1
    for p in pairs(port.keys) do port.low=math.min(port.low,p);port.high=math.max(port.high,p) end
    if port.high<port.low then port.reason="Falta asignar controles a notas";return port end
    if root:GetAttribute("PianoReady")~=true then port.reason="El instrumento no ha indicado que está listo";return port end
    port.ready,port.reason=true,nil
    return port
end
function PianoAdapter.calibrate(port,line)
    local map={}
    if line:match("^%s*$") then return map end
    for entry in (line..","):gmatch("(.-),") do
        local k,value=entry:match("^%s*(.-)%s*=%s*(.-)%s*$")
        assert(k and port.tokens[k]~=nil,"Control desconocido · "..tostring(k or entry))
        local p=noteNumber(value)
        assert(p and map[k]==nil,"Nota inválida o control repetido · "..k)
        map[k]=p
    end
    return map
end

-- PianoDetector · watches tagged instruments and two explicit registries. Changes
-- within one instrument rebuild only its descriptor, never the entire Workspace.
local PianoDetector={}
PianoDetector.__index=PianoDetector
function PianoDetector.new(tags,world,gui,onChange)
    local self=setmetatable({tags=tags,world=world,gui=gui,onChange=onChange,alive=true,
        links={},containers={},records={},dirty={},calibration=setmetatable({},{__mode="k"})},PianoDetector)
    local function watch(signal,cb) table.insert(self.links,signal:Connect(cb)) end
    watch(tags:GetInstanceAddedSignal("ReyznPiano"),function() self:request() end)
    watch(tags:GetInstanceRemovedSignal("ReyznPiano"),function() self:request() end)
    for _,home in ipairs({world,gui}) do
        local function check(c)
            if c.Name=="ReyznPianos" or self.records[c] or c:IsA("Model") or c:IsA("Folder") or c:IsA("ScreenGui") then self:request() end
        end
        watch(home.ChildAdded,check);watch(home.ChildRemoved,check)
    end
    self:scan()
    return self
end
function PianoDetector:request(root)
    if not self.alive then return end
    if root then self.dirty[root]=true end
    if self.pending then return end
    self.pending=true
    task.defer(function()
        if not self.alive then return end
        self.pending=false
        self:scan()
    end)
end
function PianoDetector:watchRoot(root)
    local links={}
    local function changed() self:request(root) end
    local function watch(signal,cb) table.insert(links,signal:Connect(cb or changed)) end
    for _,attr in ipairs({"PianoReady","ReyznAdapter","MaxVoices","MinNote","MaxNote","InstrumentName"}) do watch(root:GetAttributeChangedSignal(attr)) end
    watch(root.AncestryChanged);watch(root:GetPropertyChangedSignal("Name"))
    local function endpoint(c)
        if c.Name=="NoteOn" or c.Name=="NoteOff" then changed() end
    end
    local function structure(c) if c.Name=="Keys" then changed() else endpoint(c) end end
    watch(root.ChildAdded,structure);watch(root.ChildRemoved,structure)
    for _,name in ipairs({"NoteOn","NoteOff"}) do
        local e=root:FindFirstChild(name)
        if e then watch(e:GetPropertyChangedSignal("Name")) end
    end
    local keys=root:FindFirstChild("Keys")
    if keys then
        watch(keys:GetPropertyChangedSignal("Name"));watch(keys.ChildAdded);watch(keys.ChildRemoved)
        local controls=keys:GetChildren()
        if #controls<=256 then
            for _,key in ipairs(controls) do
                watch(key:GetAttributeChangedSignal("MidiNote"));watch(key:GetPropertyChangedSignal("Name"))
                if key:IsA("StringValue") then watch(key.Changed)
                elseif key:IsA("GuiButton") then
                    watch(key.ChildAdded,endpoint);watch(key.ChildRemoved,endpoint)
                    for _,name in ipairs({"NoteOn","NoteOff"}) do
                        local e=key:FindFirstChild(name)
                        if e then watch(e:GetPropertyChangedSignal("Name")) end
                    end
                    if key:IsA("TextButton") and not noteNumber(key:GetAttribute("MidiNote")) and not noteNumber(key.Name) then watch(key:GetPropertyChangedSignal("Text")) end
                end
            end
        end
    end
    return links
end
function PianoDetector:scan()
    local roots,containers={},{}
    for _,r in ipairs(self.tags:GetTagged("ReyznPiano")) do
        if r:IsDescendantOf(self.world) or r:IsDescendantOf(self.gui) then roots[r]=true end
    end
    for _,home in ipairs({self.world,self.gui}) do
        for _,r in ipairs(home:GetChildren()) do
            if r:GetAttribute("ReyznAdapter")~=nil or (r:GetAttribute("PianoReady")~=nil and (r:FindFirstChild("NoteOn") or r:FindFirstChild("Keys"))) then roots[r]=true end
        end
        local box=home:FindFirstChild("ReyznPianos")
        if box then
            containers[box]=true
            for _,r in ipairs(box:GetChildren()) do roots[r]=true end
            if not self.containers[box] then
                self.containers[box]={box.ChildAdded:Connect(function() self:request() end),
                    box.ChildRemoved:Connect(function() self:request() end),
                    box:GetPropertyChangedSignal("Name"):Connect(function() self:request() end)}
            end
        end
    end
    if self.manualRoot then
        if self.manualRoot:IsDescendantOf(self.world) or self.manualRoot:IsDescendantOf(self.gui) then roots[self.manualRoot]=true
        else self.manualRoot=nil end
    end
    for c,links in pairs(self.containers) do
        if not containers[c] then disconnect(links);self.containers[c]=nil end
    end
    for root,rec in pairs(self.records) do
        if not roots[root] then disconnect(rec.links);self.records[root]=nil end
    end
    local items={}
    for root in pairs(roots) do
        local record=self.records[root]
        if not record or self.dirty[root] then
            if record then disconnect(record.links) end
            record={port=PianoAdapter.inspect(root,self.calibration[root]), links=self:watchRoot(root)}
            self.records[root]=record
        end
        table.insert(items,record.port)
    end
    table.clear(self.dirty)
    table.sort(items,function(a,b) return a.name<b.name end)
    self.items=items
    self.onChange(items)
end
function PianoDetector:manual(path)
    local names=string.split(path:match("^%s*(.-)%s*$"),"/")
    local node=if names[1]=="Workspace" then self.world elseif names[1]=="PlayerGui" then self.gui else nil
    assert(node and #names>=2 and #names<=24,"Usa una ruta desde Workspace/ o PlayerGui/")
    for i=2,#names do
        node=node:FindFirstChild(names[i])
        assert(node,"No se encontró "..names[i])
    end
    assert(node:GetAttribute("PianoReady")~=nil or node:GetAttribute("ReyznAdapter")~=nil,"Esta ruta no publica una interfaz de piano")
    self.manualRoot=node;self.dirty[node]=true;self:scan()
    return self.records[node].port
end
function PianoDetector:setCalibration(port,text)
    local map=PianoAdapter.calibrate(port,text)
    local proposed=PianoAdapter.inspect(port.root,map)
    assert(proposed.ready or (proposed.high and proposed.high>=proposed.low and port.root:GetAttribute("PianoReady")~=true),proposed.reason)
    self.calibration[port.root]=map
    self.dirty[port.root]=true
    self:scan()
end
function PianoDetector:destroy()
    self.alive=false;disconnect(self.links)
    for _,r in pairs(self.records) do disconnect(r.links) end
    for _,l in pairs(self.containers) do disconnect(l) end
    table.clear(self.records);table.clear(self.containers)
end

-- A real sampled local piano. Twelve reusable Sound voices, a velocity-scaled
-- attack, natural decay and a quiet sustain loop until release. A failed asset
-- never marks the demo compatible. A host can supply its own C4 sample.
local DemoPiano={}
function DemoPiano.new(soundService,asset,rootNote,changed)
    local pool,active={},{}
    local base=Instance.new("Sound")
    base.Name="ReyznPianoReference"
    base.SoundId=asset
    base.Volume=0.28
    base.Parent=soundService
    local port={name="Piano de prueba",kind="Sampler local",voices=12,keys={},tokens={},low=36,high=96,ready=false,reason="Cargando la muestra de piano…"}
    for p=port.low,port.high do port.keys[p]=true end
    local alive=true
    local function ready()
        if not alive or not base.IsLoaded or base.TimeLength<=0 then return end
        base.PlaybackRegionsEnabled=true
        base.PlaybackRegion=NumberRange.new(0,base.TimeLength)
        base.LoopRegion=NumberRange.new(base.TimeLength*0.28,base.TimeLength*0.58)
        base.Looped=true
        port.ready,port.reason=true,nil
        changed()
    end
    local loaded=base.Loaded:Connect(ready)
    local timeout=task.delay(12,function()
        if alive and not port.ready then
            port.reason="Muestra no disponible. Revisa PianoSampleId y el permiso de audio"
            changed()
        end
    end)
    if base.IsLoaded then ready() else
        task.defer(function()
            if not alive then return end
            local ok=pcall(function() game:GetService("ContentProvider"):PreloadAsync({base}) end)
            if alive and ok and not port.ready then ready() end
        end)
    end
    port.on=function(p,v)
        assert(port.ready,"Muestra de piano pendiente")
        local voice=table.remove(pool)
        if not voice then voice=base:Clone();voice.Parent=soundService end
        active[p]=voice
        voice.PlaybackSpeed=2^((p-rootNote)/12)
        voice.Volume=0.34*v
        voice.TimePosition=0
        voice:Play()
    end
    port.off=function(p)
        local voice=active[p]
        if voice then voice:Stop();active[p]=nil;table.insert(pool,voice) end
    end
    port.destroy=function()
        alive=false;loaded:Disconnect()
        pcall(task.cancel,timeout)
        for _,v in pairs(active) do v:Destroy() end
        for _,v in ipairs(pool) do v:Destroy() end
        table.clear(active);table.clear(pool);base:Destroy()
    end
    return port
end

local SettingsManager={}
function SettingsManager.new(player,http)
    local saved={}
    local raw=player:GetAttribute("ReyznPianoSettings")
    if type(raw)=="string" then
        local ok,v=pcall(function() return http:JSONDecode(raw) end)
        if ok and type(v)=="table" then saved=v end
    end
    local self={speed=math.clamp(tonumber(saved.speed) or 1,0.25,3),
        octave=math.clamp(math.round(tonumber(saved.octave) or 0),-4,4),auto=saved.auto~=false,
        fav=if type(saved.fav)=="table" then saved.fav else {}}
    function self:save()
        player:SetAttribute("ReyznPianoSettings",http:JSONEncode({speed=self.speed,octave=self.octave,auto=self.auto,fav=self.fav}))
    end
    return self
end
local function decode64(service,data)
    data=data:gsub("%s","")
    assert(#data>0 and #data<=1398104 and #data%4==0 and data:match("^[%w+/]+=*$"),"Base64 incompleto o inválido")
    local bytes=buffer.tostring(service:Base64Decode(buffer.fromstring(data)))
    assert(#bytes<=1048576,"El máximo es 1 MiB")
    return bytes
end
local function installMidiPlugin(pluginObject,encoding,storage)
    local bar=pluginObject:CreateToolbar("REYZN PIANO")
    local btn=bar:CreateButton("ReyznImportMIDI","Añadir un archivo MIDI a la biblioteca de esta experiencia","","Importar MIDI")
    local busy=false
    btn.Click:Connect(function()
        if busy then return end
        busy=true
        local ok,err=pcall(function()
            local file=game:GetService("StudioService"):PromptImportFileAsync({"mid","midi"})
            if not file then return end
            assert(file.Size<=1048576,"El archivo supera 1 MiB")
            local bytes=file:GetBinaryContents()
            MIDIParser.parse(bytes)
            local library=storage:FindFirstChild("ReyznPianoMIDI")
            if not library then library=Instance.new("Folder");library.Name="ReyznPianoMIDI";library.Parent=storage end
            assert(library:IsA("Folder") and #library:GetChildren()<32,"La carpeta admite 32 archivos")
            local item=Instance.new("Folder")
            item.Name=file.Name
            local txt=buffer.tostring(encoding:Base64Encode(buffer.fromstring(bytes)))
            for i=1,#txt,8192 do
                local block=Instance.new("StringValue")
                block.Name=string.format("%04d",math.floor((i-1)/8192)+1)
                block.Value=txt:sub(i,i+8191)
                block.Parent=item
            end
            item:SetAttribute("BlockCount",math.ceil(#txt/8192))
            item:SetAttribute("ReyznMIDI",true)
            item.Parent=library
            print("REYZN PIANO · MIDI añadido a ReplicatedStorage · "..item.Name)
        end)
        busy=false
        if not ok then warn("REYZN PIANO · "..tostring(err)) end
    end)
end

-- InterfaceController · native Roblox GUI, pooled library rows, touch-safe live resizing.
local InterfaceController={}
function InterfaceController.new(app,gui)
    local input=game:GetService("UserInputService")
    local run=game:GetService("RunService")
    local tweens=game:GetService("TweenService")
    local links,animations={},{}
    local ui={alive=true}
    local player,clock,library,settings=app.player,app.player.scheduler,app.library,app.settings
    local function rgb(a,b,c) return Color3.fromRGB(a,b,c) end
    local bg,surface,tile,line=rgb(17,18,29),rgb(24,26,43),rgb(38,40,64),rgb(58,61,86)
    local ink,muted,lav,accent,mint=rgb(243,241,255),rgb(180,185,211),rgb(196,177,255),rgb(98,70,187),rgb(117,223,191)
    local function at(x,y) return UDim2.fromOffset(x,y) end
    local function box(parent,class,props)
        local obj=Instance.new(class)
        for k,v in pairs(props or {}) do obj[k]=v end
        obj.Parent=parent
        return obj
    end
    local function round(obj,r) box(obj,"UICorner",{CornerRadius=UDim.new(0,r or 7)}) end
    local function outline(obj,color)
        return box(obj,"UIStroke",{Color=color or line,Thickness=1,ApplyStrokeMode=Enum.ApplyStrokeMode.Border})
    end
    local function frame(parent,color,size,pos)
        return box(parent,"Frame",{BackgroundColor3=color or bg,BackgroundTransparency=if color then 0 else 1,
            Size=size or UDim2.fromScale(1,1),Position=pos or at(0,0),BorderSizePixel=0})
    end
    local function label(parent,str,size,pos,px,color,bold)
        return box(parent,"TextLabel",{Text=str,Size=size,Position=pos or at(0,0),BackgroundTransparency=1,
            Font=if bold then Enum.Font.GothamBold else Enum.Font.Gotham,TextSize=px or 13,TextColor3=color or ink,
            TextXAlignment=Enum.TextXAlignment.Left,TextTruncate=Enum.TextTruncate.AtEnd,BorderSizePixel=0})
    end
    local function animate(obj,props,duration)
        local prev=animations[obj]
        if prev then prev:Cancel();prev:Destroy() end
        local tween=tweens:Create(obj,TweenInfo.new(duration or 0.14,Enum.EasingStyle.Quad,Enum.EasingDirection.Out),props)
        animations[obj]=tween
        tween.Completed:Once(function()
            if animations[obj]==tween then animations[obj]=nil end
            tween:Destroy()
        end)
        tween:Play()
    end
    local function button(parent,str,size,pos,color,fn)
        local b=box(parent,"TextButton",{Text=str,Size=size,Position=pos or at(0,0),
            BackgroundColor3=color or tile,TextColor3=ink,BorderSizePixel=0,AutoButtonColor=false,
            Font=Enum.Font.GothamMedium,TextSize=13,TextTruncate=Enum.TextTruncate.AtEnd})
        round(b,7)
        local scale=box(b,"UIScale",{Scale=1})
        b.InputBegan:Connect(function(i)
            if i.UserInputType==Enum.UserInputType.MouseButton1 or i.UserInputType==Enum.UserInputType.Touch then animate(scale,{Scale=0.95},0.08) end
        end)
        b.InputEnded:Connect(function(i)
            if i.UserInputType==Enum.UserInputType.MouseButton1 or i.UserInputType==Enum.UserInputType.Touch then animate(scale,{Scale=1}) end
        end)
        if fn then b.Activated:Connect(fn) end
        return b
    end
    local function field(parent,hint)
        local b=box(parent,"TextBox",{Text="",PlaceholderText=hint,Size=UDim2.new(1,0,0,35),TextSize=13,
            Font=Enum.Font.Gotham,ClearTextOnFocus=false,TextXAlignment=Enum.TextXAlignment.Left,
            TextColor3=ink,PlaceholderColor3=muted,BackgroundColor3=surface,BorderSizePixel=0})
        round(b,7);local edge=outline(b)
        box(b,"UIPadding",{PaddingLeft=UDim.new(0,10),PaddingRight=UDim.new(0,8)})
        b.Focused:Connect(function() animate(edge,{Color=lav}) end)
        b.FocusLost:Connect(function() animate(edge,{Color=line}) end)
        return b
    end
    local function scrolling(parent,automatic)
        return box(parent,"ScrollingFrame",{Size=UDim2.fromScale(1,1),CanvasSize=at(0,0),
            AutomaticCanvasSize=if automatic then Enum.AutomaticSize.Y else Enum.AutomaticSize.None,
            ScrollingDirection=Enum.ScrollingDirection.Y,ScrollBarThickness=4,ScrollBarImageColor3=lav,
            VerticalScrollBarInset=Enum.ScrollBarInset.None,BackgroundTransparency=1,BorderSizePixel=0,
            ElasticBehavior=Enum.ElasticBehavior.WhenScrollable})
    end
    local function layout(parent,horiz,gap)
        return box(parent,"UIListLayout",{FillDirection=if horiz then Enum.FillDirection.Horizontal else Enum.FillDirection.Vertical,
            SortOrder=Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder,Padding=UDim.new(0,gap or 6)})
    end
    local function watch(sig,fn) table.insert(links,sig:Connect(fn)) end
    local function press(i) return i.UserInputType==Enum.UserInputType.Touch or i.UserInputType==Enum.UserInputType.MouseButton1 end
    local screen=frame(gui,nil)
    local win=frame(screen,bg,at(400,408));win.Name="PianoWindow";win.ClipsDescendants=true;round(win,12);outline(win,line)
    local head=frame(win,surface,UDim2.new(1,0,0,44))
    box(head,"UIGradient",{Color=ColorSequence.new(surface,rgb(42,34,65)),Rotation=8})
    local mark=frame(head,accent,at(28,28),at(10,8));round(mark,7)
    for i,h in ipairs({10,16,12,18}) do round(frame(mark,if i==2 then lav else ink,at(3,h),at(5+(i-1)*5,math.floor((28-h)/2))),2) end
    label(head,"REYZN PIANO",UDim2.new(1,-133,0,20),at(45,4),14,ink,true)
    local status=label(head,"",UDim2.new(1,-136,0,17),at(45,23),11,muted)
    local grab=box(head,"TextButton",{Text="",BackgroundTransparency=1,Size=UDim2.new(1,-87,1,0),AutoButtonColor=false})
    local minimize,closeBtn
    local body=frame(win,nil)
    local tabbar=frame(body,nil,UDim2.new(1,-16,0,34),at(8,1))
    local pages,tabButtons={},{}
    local pageArea=frame(body,nil)
    local dock=frame(body,surface)
    local tabs={"Biblioteca","Cola","Pianos","MIDI"}
    local currentTab,category,query="Biblioteca","Todas",""
    local selected=library.all[1]
    local currentRows,pool={},{}
    local notice,noticeUntil="",0
    local refresh,filter,paint,chooseTab,schedulePaint,updatePorts
    local minimized=false
    for i,name in ipairs(tabs) do
        local b=button(tabbar,name,UDim2.new(0.25,-4,1,-2),UDim2.new((i-1)/4,2,0,0),tile,function() chooseTab(name) end)
        tabButtons[name]=b
        local panel=frame(pageArea,nil);panel.Visible=name==currentTab
        pages[name]=panel
    end
    local lib=pages.Biblioteca
    local search=field(lib,"Buscar título o compositor");search.Size=UDim2.new(1,-4,0,33);search.Position=at(2,1)
    local cats=box(lib,"ScrollingFrame",{Position=at(0,40),Size=UDim2.new(1,0,0,31),BackgroundTransparency=1,
        CanvasSize=at(0,0),AutomaticCanvasSize=Enum.AutomaticSize.X,ScrollingDirection=Enum.ScrollingDirection.X,
        ScrollBarThickness=2,ScrollBarImageColor3=lav,BorderSizePixel=0})
    layout(cats,true,5)
    local catButtons={}
    local filters={"Todas","Favoritos","Classical","Romantic","Emotional","Fast Piano","Relaxing","Cinematic","MIDI"}
    for i,c in ipairs(filters) do
        local b=button(cats,c,at(math.max(52,#c*7+19),26),nil,tile,function()
            category=c;filter()
        end)
        b.LayoutOrder=i;b.TextSize=11;catButtons[c]=b
    end
    local list=scrolling(lib,false)
    list.Position=at(0,76);list.Size=UDim2.new(1,0,1,-76)
    local empty=label(lib,"Sin coincidencias",UDim2.new(1,-8,0,32),at(4,78),13,muted)
    local queuePage=pages.Cola
    local clearQ=button(queuePage,"Vaciar cola",at(98,34),nil,tile,function()
        table.clear(player.queue);refresh()
    end)
    local queueHelp=label(queuePage,"El botón + añade una pieza",UDim2.new(1,-111,0,34),at(107,0),12,muted)
    local queueList=scrolling(queuePage,false);queueList.Position=at(0,39);queueList.Size=UDim2.new(1,0,1,-39)
    local rowH,queuePool=47,{}
    local function row(scroll,isQueue)
        local r={}
        r.box=frame(scroll,surface,UDim2.new(1,-6,0,rowH-3));round(r.box,6)
        r.stripe=frame(r.box,accent,at(3,24),at(0,10));round(r.stripe,2)
        local reserve=if isQueue then 52 else 88
        r.title=label(r.box,"",UDim2.new(1,-reserve-14,0,19),at(10,3),13,ink,true)
        r.info=label(r.box,"",UDim2.new(1,-reserve-14,0,17),at(10,23),11,muted)
        local hit=box(r.box,"TextButton",{Text="",AutoButtonColor=false,BackgroundTransparency=1,Size=UDim2.new(1,-reserve,1,0)})
        hit.Activated:Connect(function()
            if not r.song then return end
            if isQueue then
                if player:play(r.song) then table.remove(player.queue,r.i);refresh() end
            else
                selected=r.song
                if clock.state=="playing" and player.current~=selected then player:play(selected) end
                refresh()
            end
        end)
        if isQueue then
            r.remove=button(r.box,"×",at(37,34),UDim2.new(1,-42,0,5),tile,function()
                if r.song then table.remove(player.queue,r.i);refresh() end
            end)
        else
            r.star=button(r.box,"☆",at(37,34),UDim2.new(1,-83,0,5),tile,function()
                if not r.song then return end
                settings.fav[r.song.id]=if settings.fav[r.song.id] then nil else true
                settings:save()
                if category=="Favoritos" then filter() else paint() end
            end)
            r.star.TextSize=19
            button(r.box,"+",at(37,34),UDim2.new(1,-42,0,5),tile,function() if r.song then player:enqueue(r.song) end end)
        end
        return r
    end
    local function timeText(s) s=math.floor(s or 0);return string.format("%d:%02d",math.floor(s/60),s%60) end
    local function paintList(scroll,rows,widgets,isQueue)
        local needed=math.min(#rows,math.max(0,math.ceil(scroll.AbsoluteSize.Y/rowH))+2)
        local first=math.max(1,math.floor(scroll.CanvasPosition.Y/rowH)+1)
        for i=1,math.max(needed,#widgets) do
            local r=widgets[i]
            if not r then r=row(scroll,isQueue);widgets[i]=r end
            local index=first+i-1
            local song=if i<=needed then rows[index] else nil
            r.song,r.i=song,index;r.box.Visible=song~=nil
            if song then
                r.box.Position=at(0,(index-1)*rowH)
                local active=(song==selected and not isQueue) or (isQueue and song==player.current)
                r.stripe.Visible=active
                r.title.Text=song.title
                r.title.TextColor3=if active then lav else ink
                r.info.Text=song.composer.."  ·  "..timeText(song.duration)
                if r.star then r.star.Text=if settings.fav[song.id] then "★" else "☆";r.star.TextColor3=if settings.fav[song.id] then lav else muted end
            end
        end
    end
    paint=function()
        if not ui.alive then return end
        if currentTab=="Biblioteca" then paintList(list,currentRows,pool,false)
        elseif currentTab=="Cola" then paintList(queueList,player.queue,queuePool,true) end
    end
    filter=function()
        table.clear(currentRows)
        for _,s in ipairs(library.all) do
            local matches=category=="Todas" or (category=="Favoritos" and settings.fav[s.id]) or s.category==category
            if matches and (query=="" or (s.title.." "..s.composer):lower():find(query,1,true)) then table.insert(currentRows,s) end
        end
        for c,b in pairs(catButtons) do b.BackgroundColor3=if c==category then accent else tile end
        list.CanvasSize=at(0,#currentRows*rowH);list.CanvasPosition=Vector2.zero;empty.Visible=#currentRows==0;paint()
    end
    search:GetPropertyChangedSignal("Text"):Connect(function() query=search.Text:lower();filter() end)
    for _,s in ipairs({list,queueList}) do
        s:GetPropertyChangedSignal("CanvasPosition"):Connect(paint)
        s:GetPropertyChangedSignal("AbsoluteSize"):Connect(paint)
    end

    -- Common vertical settings panels: each may scroll independently of the dock.
    local function stack(parent)
        local scroll=scrolling(parent,true);layout(scroll,false,7)
        box(scroll,"UIPadding",{PaddingRight=UDim.new(0,7),PaddingLeft=UDim.new(0,2),PaddingTop=UDim.new(0,2),PaddingBottom=UDim.new(0,8)})
        local count=0
        return scroll,function(obj)
            count+=1;obj.LayoutOrder=count;return obj
        end
    end
    local ps,put=stack(pages.Pianos)
    local function paragraph(parent,text,height)
        local l=label(parent,text,UDim2.new(1,0,0,height or 34),nil,12,muted)
        l.TextWrapped=true;l.TextTruncate=Enum.TextTruncate.None
        return l
    end
    local function controlRow(parent,add,text,left,right)
        local holder=add(frame(parent,surface,UDim2.new(1,0,0,38)));round(holder,7)
        local desc=label(holder,text,UDim2.new(1,-97,1,0),at(9,0),13,ink,true)
        button(holder,"−",at(38,32),UDim2.new(1,-84,0,3),tile,left)
        button(holder,"+",at(38,32),UDim2.new(1,-42,0,3),tile,right)
        return desc
    end
    local picker=put(button(ps,"",UDim2.new(1,0,0,38),nil,tile,function() app:cyclePort() end))
    local description=put(paragraph(ps,"",33))
    local function setSpeed(d)
        settings.speed=math.clamp(math.round((settings.speed+d)*100)/100,0.25,3)
        clock:setSpeed(settings.speed);settings:save();refresh()
    end
    local speedLabel=controlRow(ps,put,"",function() setSpeed(-0.25) end,function() setSpeed(0.25) end)
    local function setOctave(d)
        settings.octave=math.clamp(settings.octave+d,-4,4);clock:transpose(settings.octave,settings.auto);settings:save();refresh()
    end
    local octLabel=controlRow(ps,put,"",function() setOctave(-1) end,function() setOctave(1) end)
    local autoButton=put(button(ps,"",UDim2.new(1,0,0,34),nil,tile,function()
        settings.auto=not settings.auto;clock:transpose(settings.octave,settings.auto);settings:save();refresh()
    end))
    put(paragraph(ps,"Prueba las teclas aquí. En PC usa A W S E D F T G Y H U J K.",32))
    local keyboard=put(frame(ps,nil,UDim2.new(1,0,0,51)))
    local white={0,2,4,5,7,9,11,12}
    local function keyButton(offset,x,w,h,black)
        local b=box(keyboard,"TextButton",{Size=UDim2.new(w,-2,0,h),Position=UDim2.new(x,1,0,0),Text=if offset==0 then "C4" else "",
            TextColor3=tile,TextSize=10,Font=Enum.Font.GothamMedium,TextYAlignment=Enum.TextYAlignment.Bottom,
            BackgroundColor3=if black then tile else rgb(218,218,239),AutoButtonColor=false,BorderSizePixel=0,ZIndex=if black then 3 else 2})
        round(b,3)
        b.InputBegan:Connect(function(i) if press(i) then app:press(i,60+offset) end end)
        b.InputEnded:Connect(function(i) if press(i) then app:release(i) end end)
    end
    for j,p in ipairs(white) do keyButton(p,(j-1)/8,1/8,50,false) end
    for j,p in pairs({[1]=1,[2]=3,[4]=6,[5]=8,[6]=10}) do keyButton(p,j/8-0.038,0.076,30,true) end
    local calHelp=put(paragraph(ps,"",48))
    local cal=put(field(ps,"Ejemplo: A=C4, S=D4"))
    local applyCal=put(button(ps,"Aplicar calibración",UDim2.new(1,0,0,36),nil,tile,function()
        if not player.port or not player.port.root then return end
        local ok,e=pcall(function() app.detector:setCalibration(player.port,cal.Text) end)
        player:notify(if ok then "Calibración aplicada" else tostring(e))
    end))
    local manualPath=put(field(ps,"Workspace/Escenario/Piano"))
    put(button(ps,"Seleccionar piano por ruta",UDim2.new(1,0,0,36),nil,tile,function()
        local ok,port=pcall(function() return app.detector:manual(manualPath.Text) end)
        if not ok then player:notify(tostring(port));return end
        app.pinned=true;app.lost=false;app:selectPort(port)
        player:notify(port.name.." · "..(if port.ready then "Listo" else port.reason))
    end))
    local m,add=stack(pages.MIDI)
    add(paragraph(m,"Importa un MIDI propio o autorizado. Pega su Base64. Para archivos largos, añade bloques de hasta 12 000 caracteres.",48))
    local midiTitle=add(field(m,"Título de la pieza"))
    local midiData=add(field(m,"Datos MIDI en Base64"))
    midiData.Size=UDim2.new(1,0,0,59);midiData.MultiLine=true;midiData.TextWrapped=true
    local parts,partLength={},0
    local partInfo=add(paragraph(m,"0 caracteres añadidos",21))
    local function appendChunk()
        local txt=midiData.Text:gsub("%s","")
        if #txt==0 then return true end
        if #txt>12000 or partLength+#txt>1398104 or not txt:match("^[%w+/=]+$") then
            player:notify("Comprueba el Base64 y el tamaño del bloque");return false
        end
        table.insert(parts,txt);partLength+=#txt;midiData.Text=""
        partInfo.Text=partLength.." caracteres añadidos";return true
    end
    add(button(m,"Añadir bloque",UDim2.new(1,0,0,35),nil,tile,appendChunk))
    add(button(m,"Importar MIDI",UDim2.new(1,0,0,38),nil,accent,function()
        if not appendChunk() then return end
        local ok,s=pcall(function() return library:import(if midiTitle.Text:match("%S") then midiTitle.Text:sub(1,(utf8.offset(midiTitle.Text,91) or (#midiTitle.Text+1))-1) else "Mi MIDI",decode64(app.encoding,table.concat(parts))) end)
        if not ok then player:notify(tostring(s));return end
        selected=s;table.clear(parts);partLength=0;midiTitle.Text="";partInfo.Text="0 caracteres añadidos"
        category="MIDI";search.Text="";filter();chooseTab("Biblioteca");player:notify("MIDI importado · "..s.title)
    end))
    add(button(m,"Limpiar bloques",UDim2.new(1,0,0,33),nil,tile,function()
        table.clear(parts);partLength=0;midiData.Text="";partInfo.Text="0 caracteres añadidos"
    end))
    add(paragraph(m,"En Studio, el complemento REYZN PIANO importa archivos .mid o .midi desde tu equipo.",42))
    local now=label(dock,"",UDim2.new(1,-130,0,18),at(12,5),13,ink,true)
    local meta=label(dock,"",UDim2.new(1,-110,0,15),at(12,24),10,muted)
    local tm=label(dock,"",at(91,16),UDim2.new(1,-102,0,24),10,muted)
    tm.TextXAlignment=Enum.TextXAlignment.Right
    local bars={}
    local strip=frame(dock,nil,at(90,13),UDim2.new(1,-102,0,7))
    for i=1,12 do
        local bar=frame(strip,tile,at(5,5),at((i-1)*7,7));round(bar,2);bars[i]=bar
    end
    local seekBar=box(dock,"TextButton",{Text="",Size=UDim2.new(1,-22,0,18),Position=at(11,37),
        BackgroundTransparency=1,AutoButtonColor=false})
    local track=frame(seekBar,line,UDim2.new(1,0,0,3),at(0,8));round(track,2)
    local fill=frame(track,lav,at(0,3));round(fill,2)
    local controls=frame(dock,nil,UDim2.new(1,-60,0,34),at(10,56))
    local function transport(str,x,width,func,primary)
        return button(controls,str,UDim2.new(width,-3,1,0),UDim2.new(x,0,0,0),if primary then accent else tile,func)
    end
    local play=transport("▶  Tocar",0,.34,function()
        if not selected then return end
        if player.current~=selected or clock.state=="stopped" then player:play(selected)
        elseif clock.state=="playing" then clock:pause();refresh()
        else app:releaseAll();clock:resume();refresh() end
    end,true)
    transport("■",.34,.16,function() app:releaseAll();clock:stop();refresh() end)
    transport("»",.50,.16,function() player:advance(false);refresh() end)
    local repeatBtn=transport("↻",.66,.17,function() player.repeatOne=not player.repeatOne;player:notify(if player.repeatOne then "Repetir pieza activado" else "Repetir pieza desactivado") end)
    local mixBtn=transport("⇄",.83,.17,function() player.shuffle=not player.shuffle;player:notify(if player.shuffle then "Aleatorio activado" else "Aleatorio desactivado") end)
    repeatBtn.TextSize=19;mixBtn.TextSize=19
    local grip=button(dock,"",at(40,35),UDim2.new(1,-45,0,55),tile,nil)
    grip.Name="ArrastraParaRedimensionar"
    for j=0,2 do
        local dash=frame(grip,lav,at(5+j*4,2),at(23-j*3,22-j*3));dash.Rotation=-45
    end
    local w,h,x,y=420,430,12,12
    local placed=false
    local compact=false
    local function sizeWindow(tween)
        local viewport=screen.AbsoluteSize
        if viewport.X<1 or viewport.Y<1 then return end
        local maxW,maxH=math.max(1,viewport.X-8),math.max(1,viewport.Y-8)
        if not placed then
            w=math.min(w,if input.TouchEnabled then 360 else 420,maxW)
            h=math.min(h,if input.TouchEnabled then 390 else 430,maxH)
            x=math.round((viewport.X-w)/2);y=math.round((viewport.Y-h)/2);placed=true
        end
        w=math.clamp(w,math.min(278,maxW),maxW);h=math.clamp(h,math.min(244,maxH),maxH)
        local drawH=if minimized then 44 else h
        local drawW=if minimized then math.min(252,w) else w
        x=math.clamp(x,4,math.max(4,viewport.X-drawW-4));y=math.clamp(y,4,math.max(4,viewport.Y-drawH-4))
        win.Position=at(x,y)
        if tween then animate(win,{Size=at(drawW,drawH)},0.18)
        else
            if animations[win] then animations[win]:Cancel() end
            win.Size=at(drawW,drawH)
        end
        body.Size=UDim2.new(1,0,0,h-44);body.Position=at(0,44);body.Visible=not minimized
        compact=h<325
        local bottom=if compact then 80 else 97
        pageArea.Position=at(10,39);pageArea.Size=UDim2.new(1,-20,1,-bottom-42)
        dock.Size=UDim2.new(1,0,0,bottom);dock.Position=UDim2.new(0,0,1,-bottom)
        meta.Visible=not compact
        tm.Position=UDim2.new(1,-103,0,if compact then 3 else 24)
        strip.Visible=not compact
        seekBar.Position=at(11,if compact then 18 else 37)
        controls.Position=at(10,if compact then 38 else 56)
        grip.Position=UDim2.new(1,-45,0,if compact then 37 else 55)
        search.Size=UDim2.new(1,-4,0,if compact then 27 else 33)
        cats.Position=at(0,if compact then 30 else 40)
        local listTop=if compact then 59 else 76
        list.Position=at(0,listTop);list.Size=UDim2.new(1,0,1,-listTop)
        empty.Position=at(4,listTop)
    end
    minimize=button(head,"−",at(36,34),UDim2.new(1,-80,0,5),tile,function()
        minimized=not minimized;minimize.Text=if minimized then "□" else "−"
        app:releaseAll();sizeWindow(true)
        if not minimized then filter() end
    end)
    closeBtn=button(head,"×",at(36,34),UDim2.new(1,-40,0,5),tile,function() app:destroy() end)
    minimize.TextSize=19;closeBtn.TextSize=21
    local gesture
    local function begin(mode,i)
        if not press(i) then return end
        gesture={mode=mode,input=i,start=i.Position,x=x,y=y,w=w,h=h}
    end
    grab.InputBegan:Connect(function(i) begin("move",i) end)
    grip.InputBegan:Connect(function(i) begin("resize",i) end)
    local function seekTo(px)
        if player.current==selected and clock.score and track.AbsoluteSize.X>0 then
            clock:seek(clock.score.duration*math.clamp((px-track.AbsolutePosition.X)/track.AbsoluteSize.X,0,1))
            if ui.draw then ui.draw() end
        end
    end
    seekBar.InputBegan:Connect(function(i) if press(i) then begin("seek",i);seekTo(i.Position.X) end end)
    watch(input.InputChanged,function(i)
        if not gesture then return end
        if i~=gesture.input and not (gesture.input.UserInputType==Enum.UserInputType.MouseButton1 and i.UserInputType==Enum.UserInputType.MouseMovement) then return end
        local dx,dy=i.Position.X-gesture.start.X,i.Position.Y-gesture.start.Y
        if gesture.mode=="seek" then seekTo(i.Position.X);return
        elseif gesture.mode=="move" then x=gesture.x+dx;y=gesture.y+dy
        else w=gesture.w+dx;h=gesture.h+dy end
        sizeWindow(false)
    end)
    local computerKeys={A=0,W=1,S=2,E=3,D=4,F=5,T=6,G=7,Y=8,H=9,U=10,J=11,K=12}
    watch(input.InputBegan,function(i,handled)
        if handled or minimized or currentTab~="Pianos" or input:GetFocusedTextBox() then return end
        local offset=computerKeys[i.KeyCode.Name]
        if offset and i.UserInputType==Enum.UserInputType.Keyboard then app:press(i.KeyCode,60+offset) end
    end)
    watch(input.InputEnded,function(i)
        if gesture and (i==gesture.input or (i.UserInputType==Enum.UserInputType.MouseButton1 and gesture.input.UserInputType==Enum.UserInputType.MouseButton1)) then gesture=nil end
        app:release(i)
        if i.UserInputType==Enum.UserInputType.Keyboard then app:release(i.KeyCode) end
    end)
    watch(input.WindowFocusReleased,function() gesture=nil;app:releaseAll() end)
    watch(screen:GetPropertyChangedSignal("AbsoluteSize"),function() sizeWindow(false) end)
    local lastRevision,lastManual,lastCurrent=-1,-1,nil
    local lastPort
    local activeNames=""
    local function portSummary(port)
        if not port then return "Sin piano seleccionado" end
        if not port.ready then return port.reason or "Incompatible" end
        return port.kind.."  ·  "..pitchName(port.low).."–"..pitchName(port.high).."  ·  "..port.voices..(if port.voices==1 then " voz" else " voces")
    end
    updatePorts=function()
        local port=player.port
        picker.Text=(if port then port.name else "Seleccionar piano").."   ›"
        description.Text=portSummary(port)
        speedLabel.Text=string.format("Velocidad   %g×",settings.speed)
        octLabel.Text=string.format("Octava   %+d",settings.octave)
        autoButton.Text="Octava automática   "..(if settings.auto then "Sí" else "No")
        autoButton.TextColor3=if settings.auto then lav else muted
        local mapped=port and port.root and next(port.tokens)~=nil
        cal.Visible=mapped==true;calHelp.Visible=cal.Visible;applyCal.Visible=cal.Visible
        if mapped then
            local tokens={}
            for token,p in pairs(port.tokens) do table.insert(tokens,token..(if p then "="..pitchName(p) else "=?")) end
            table.sort(tokens)
            local preview=table.concat(tokens,", ",1,math.min(8,#tokens))
            calHelp.Text="Calibración manual · "..preview..(if #tokens>8 then "…" else "")
            if port~=lastPort then
                local map=app.detector and app.detector.calibration[port.root]
                local lines={}
                for key,p in pairs(map or {}) do table.insert(lines,key.."="..pitchName(p)) end
                table.sort(lines);cal.Text=table.concat(lines,", ")
            end
        end
        lastPort=port
    end
    local renderConn,lastDraw=nil,-1
    ui.draw=function()
        if not ui.alive then return end
        local t=os.clock()
        local port=player.port
        local note=if t<noticeUntil then notice else nil
        if note then status.Text=note;status.TextColor3=lav
        else
            status.Text=if port then (if port.ready then "●  " else "○  ")..port.name..(if port.ready then "" else " · "..(port.reason or "Incompatible")) else "Sin piano compatible"
            status.TextColor3=if port and port.ready then mint else muted
        end
        local pos=if player.current==selected then clock:position() else 0
        tm.Text=timeText(pos).." / "..timeText(selected.duration)
        fill.Size=UDim2.new(math.clamp(pos/math.max(0.001,selected.duration),0,1),0,0,3)
        if clock.revision~=lastRevision or app.manualRevision~=lastManual then
            local active,notes={},{}
            for p in pairs(clock.sounding) do active[p%12+1]=true;table.insert(notes,p) end
            for p in pairs(app.manualCounts) do active[p%12+1]=true;table.insert(notes,p) end
            table.sort(notes)
            local names={}
            for i=1,math.min(#notes,4) do names[i]=pitchName(notes[i]) end
            activeNames=table.concat(names," ")
            for i,bar in ipairs(bars) do
                bar.BackgroundColor3=if active[i] then lav else tile
                bar.Size=at(5,if active[i] then 12 else 5);bar.Position=at((i-1)*7,if active[i] then 0 else 7)
            end
            lastRevision,lastManual=clock.revision,app.manualRevision
        end
        if not note and activeNames~="" then status.Text=status.Text.."  ·  "..activeNames end
        if clock.state~="playing" and not note and renderConn then renderConn:Disconnect();renderConn=nil end
    end
    schedulePaint=function()
        ui.draw()
        if not renderConn and (clock.state=="playing" or os.clock()<noticeUntil) then
            renderConn=run.Heartbeat:Connect(function()
                if os.clock()-lastDraw>=0.08 then lastDraw=os.clock();ui.draw() end
            end)
        end
    end
    refresh=function(message)
        if not ui.alive then return end
        if message then notice=message;noticeUntil=os.clock()+4 end
        if player.current~=lastCurrent then
            if player.current then selected=player.current end
            lastCurrent=player.current
        end
        now.Text=selected.title
        meta.Text=selected.composer.."  ·  "..string.format("%g BPM",selected.bpm).."  ·  "..selected.level
        play.Text=if player.current==selected and clock.state=="playing" then "Ⅱ  Pausa" elseif player.current==selected and clock.state=="paused" then "▶  Seguir" else "▶  Tocar"
        repeatBtn.BackgroundColor3=if player.repeatOne then accent else tile
        mixBtn.BackgroundColor3=if player.shuffle then accent else tile
        tabButtons.Cola.Text=if #player.queue>0 then "Cola ("..#player.queue..")" else "Cola"
        queueList.CanvasSize=at(0,#player.queue*rowH)
        queueHelp.Text=if #player.queue==0 then "El botón + añade una pieza" else #player.queue.." en espera"
        updatePorts();paint();schedulePaint()
    end
    chooseTab=function(tab)
        if tab~=currentTab then app:releaseAll() end
        currentTab=tab
        for name,p in pairs(pages) do
            p.Visible=name==tab
            animate(tabButtons[name],{BackgroundColor3=if name==tab then accent else tile})
        end
        if tab=="Biblioteca" then filter() end
        refresh()
    end
    ui.refresh=refresh
    ui.libraryChanged=function() filter();refresh() end
    ui.destroy=function(alreadyDestroying)
        if not ui.alive then return end
        ui.alive=false
        if renderConn then renderConn:Disconnect();renderConn=nil end
        disconnect(links)
        for _,t in pairs(animations) do t:Cancel();t:Destroy() end
        table.clear(animations)
        if not alreadyDestroying then gui:Destroy() end
    end
    sizeWindow(false);chooseTab("Biblioteca")
    return ui
end

-- Functional suite. Set RunPianoTests=true on the LocalScript to run in Studio.
local SelfTest={}
function SelfTest.run(library)
    local checks,notes,varTempo=0,0,0
    local function check(condition,msg)
        assert(condition,"REYZN · prueba fallida · "..msg);checks+=1
    end
    local function near(a,b) return math.abs(a-b)<0.0001 end
    check(#CatalogRows==200,"200 títulos")
    local titles,ids={},{}
    for _,s in ipairs(library.all) do
        if not s.row then continue end
        local score=library:score(s)
        check(not ids[s.id] and not titles[s.title:lower()],"obra única "..s.title)
        ids[s.id],titles[s.title:lower()]=true,true
        check(#score.notes>0 and math.abs(score.duration-s.duration)<0.0011 and near(score.bpm,s.bpm),s.title.." · metadatos")
        local prev=-1
        for _,n in ipairs(score.notes) do
            assert(n.start>=prev and n.finish>n.start and n.finish<=score.duration+0.00001 and whole(n.pitch,0,127)
                and whole(n.velocity,1,127),"Nota inválida en "..s.title)
            prev=n.start
        end
        notes+=#score.notes
        if #score.tempos>1 then varTempo+=1 end
    end
    check(varTempo>0,"cambios de tempo en catálogo")
    local function u32(n) return string.char(0,0,math.floor(n/256),n%256) end
    local function chunk(bytes) return "MTrk"..u32(#bytes)..bytes end
    local function smf(format,tracks)
        return "MThd"..u32(6)..string.char(0,format,0,#tracks,0,96)..table.concat(tracks)
    end
    local function b(...) return string.char(...) end
    local ending=b(0,255,47,0)
    local tempo=chunk(b(0,255,81,3,7,161,32,96,255,81,3,15,66,64)..ending)
    local melody=chunk(b(0,144,60,80,0,64,94,0,176,64,127,96,128,60,0,0,64,0,96,176,64,0)..ending)
    local score=MIDIParser.parse(smf(1,{tempo,melody}))
    check(#score.notes==2 and #score.tempos==2 and near(score.duration,1.5),"SMF 1, tempo global")
    check(near(score.notes[1].finish,1.5) and near(score.notes[2].finish,1.5),"acorde y pedal CC64")
    check(not pcall(MIDIParser.parse,"broken"),"rechaza archivo inválido")
    check(not pcall(MIDIParser.parse,smf(2,{melody})),"rechaza SMF 2")
    check(not pcall(MIDIParser.parse,smf(0,{melody}):sub(1,-3)),"rechaza truncamiento")
    local repeated=chunk(b(0,144,60,70,48,60,90,48,128,60,0,48,60,0)..ending)
    local overlap=MIDIParser.parse(smf(0,{repeated}))
    check(#overlap.notes==2 and near(overlap.notes[1].finish,0.5) and near(overlap.notes[2].finish,0.75),"running status y unísonos superpuestos")
    local now,frame,active,ons=0,nil,{},0
    local sched=PlaybackScheduler.new(function() return now end,function(fn)
        assert(not frame,"Doble reloj");frame=fn
        return {Disconnect=function() frame=nil end}
    end)
    local port={keys={[60]=true,[64]=true},voices=2,ready=true,
        on=function(p) assert(not active[p]);active[p]=true;ons+=1 end,
        off=function(p) active[p]=nil end}
    sched:load(score,port);sched:resume()
    check(active[60] and active[64] and frame,"acorde real en adaptador")
    now=0.25;frame();sched:pause()
    check(next(active)==nil and not frame and near(sched:position(),0.25),"pausa y liberación")
    now=8;sched:resume();check(active[60] and active[64],"restaura nota sostenida")
    sched:setSpeed(3);now+=0.25;frame()
    check(near(sched:position(),1),"ancla al cambiar velocidad")
    sched:seek(0.14);check(near(sched:position(),0.14),"búsqueda")
    sched:stop();check(next(active)==nil and frame==nil,"cancelación inmediata")
    port.voices=1;sched:load(score,port);sched:resume()
    check(active[64] and not active[60],"melodía en piano monofónico")
    sched:stop()
    local stalled={duration=2,notes={{id=1,start=0.1,finish=0.2,pitch=60,velocity=90},{id=2,start=1,finish=1.8,pitch=64,velocity=80}}}
    sched:load(stalled,port);sched:setSpeed(1);sched:resume()
    local before=ons;now+=1.2;frame()
    check(ons==before+1 and active[64],"descarta ataques caducados tras un salto")
    sched:stop()
    local map=NoteMapper.build({notes={{pitch=83},{pitch=78}}},{[59]=true},0,true)
    check(map[83]==59 and map[78]==nil,"octavas y huecos")
    check(noteNumber("Db4")==61 and noteNumber("B-1")==11 and noteNumber("C99")==nil,"nombres de notas")
    local cal=PianoAdapter.calibrate({tokens={A=false,S=62}},"A=C4, S=D4")
    check(cal.A==60 and cal.S==62,"calibración")
    check(not pcall(PianoAdapter.calibrate,{tokens={A=false}},"Z=C4"),"rechaza control inexistente")
    local fakeLibrary={all={{id="a",title="A"},{id="b",title="B"},{id="c",title="C"}}}
    function fakeLibrary:score() return score end
    local auto=AutoPlayer.new(fakeLibrary,sched);auto:setPort(port)
    auto:enqueue(fakeLibrary.all[2]);auto:play(fakeLibrary.all[1]);auto:advance(true)
    check(auto.current.id=="b" and #auto.queue==0,"cola FIFO")
    auto.repeatOne=true;auto:advance(true);check(auto.current.id=="b","repetición")
    auto.repeatOne=false;auto.shuffle=true;auto:advance(true);check(auto.current.id~="b","aleatorio")
    auto:setPort(nil);check(not auto:play(fakeLibrary.all[1]) and not frame,"incompatibilidad")
    return string.format("%d comprobaciones · 200 piezas · %d notas · %d piezas con cambios de tempo",checks,notes,varTempo)
end
function SelfTest.adapters()
    local root=Instance.new("Folder")
    local function add(class,name,parent)
        local child=Instance.new(class);child.Name=name;child.Parent=parent;return child
    end
    local ok,err=pcall(function()
        root:SetAttribute("PianoReady",true);root:SetAttribute("MaxVoices",4)
        local keys=add("Folder","Keys",root)
        local key=add("StringValue","Central",keys);key.Value="Q"
        local on=add("BindableEvent","NoteOn",root);local off=add("BindableEvent","NoteOff",root)
        local log={}
        on.Event:Connect(function(p,v) table.insert(log,{p,v}) end)
        off.Event:Connect(function(p) table.insert(log,{p}) end)
        local keyboard=PianoAdapter.inspect(root,{Q=60})
        assert(keyboard.ready and keyboard.kind=="Keyboard" and keyboard.voices==4)
        keyboard.on(60,0.75);keyboard.off(60);task.wait()
        assert(#log==2 and log[1][1]=="Q" and log[1][2]==0.75 and log[2][1]=="Q")
        root:SetAttribute("ReyznAdapter","GuiKeys")
        local button=add("TextButton","C#4",keys)
        local down=add("BindableEvent","NoteOn",button);local up=add("BindableEvent","NoteOff",button)
        local sawDown,sawUp=false,false
        down.Event:Connect(function(v) sawDown=v==0.5 end);up.Event:Connect(function() sawUp=true end)
        local graphical=PianoAdapter.inspect(root)
        assert(graphical.ready and graphical.low==61 and graphical.high==61)
        graphical.on(61,0.5);graphical.off(61);task.wait()
        assert(sawDown and sawUp)
        root:SetAttribute("ReyznAdapter","Midi");root:SetAttribute("MinNote",48);root:SetAttribute("MaxNote",72)
        local midi=PianoAdapter.inspect(root)
        assert(midi.ready and midi.keys[48] and midi.keys[72] and not midi.keys[73])
        midi.on(64,1);midi.off(64);task.wait();assert(log[3][1]==64 and log[4][1]==64)
        root:SetAttribute("PianoReady",false);assert(not PianoAdapter.inspect(root).ready)
        root:SetAttribute("PianoReady",true);off:Destroy();assert(not PianoAdapter.inspect(root).ready)
    end)
    root:Destroy()
    assert(ok,err)
    return "Tres contratos de piano comprobados"
end

local function startClient()
    local players=game:GetService("Players")
    local run=game:GetService("RunService")
    local encoding=game:GetService("EncodingService")
    local storage=game:GetService("ReplicatedStorage")
    if plugin then installMidiPlugin(plugin,encoding,storage);return end
    if not run:IsClient() then warn("REYZN PIANO · Instala el LocalScript en StarterPlayerScripts");return end
    local user=players.LocalPlayer
    local playerGui=user:WaitForChild("PlayerGui",15)
    if not playerGui or playerGui:FindFirstChild("ReyznPianoV1") then return end
    local gui=Instance.new("ScreenGui")
    gui.Name="ReyznPianoV1";gui.ResetOnSpawn=false;gui.DisplayOrder=12
    gui.ZIndexBehavior=Enum.ZIndexBehavior.Sibling;gui.Parent=playerGui
    local library=SongLibrary.new(function(txt)
        local compressed=encoding:Base64Decode(buffer.fromstring(txt))
        return buffer.tostring(encoding:DecompressBuffer(compressed,Enum.CompressionAlgorithm.Zstd))
    end)
    local scheduler=PlaybackScheduler.new(os.clock,function(f) return run.Heartbeat:Connect(f) end)
    local settings=SettingsManager.new(user,game:GetService("HttpService"))
    scheduler:setSpeed(settings.speed);scheduler:transpose(settings.octave,settings.auto)
    local player=AutoPlayer.new(library,scheduler)
    local app={alive=true,player=player,library=library,settings=settings,encoding=encoding,
        manual={},manualCounts={},manualRevision=0,choices={},links={}}
    local function draw() if app.ui and app.alive then app.ui.draw() end end
    function app:release(key)
        local p=self.manual[key]
        if not p then return end
        self.manual[key]=nil
        self.manualCounts[p]-=1
        if self.manualCounts[p]==0 then self.manualCounts[p]=nil;if player.port then pcall(player.port.off,p) end end
        self.manualRevision+=1;draw()
    end
    function app:releaseAll()
        for k in pairs(self.manual) do self:release(k) end
    end
    function app:press(key,note)
        local port=player.port
        if not port or not port.ready or self.manual[key] then return end
        if scheduler.state=="playing" then scheduler:pause();player:notify("Pausa · teclado manual") end
        local p=NoteMapper.build({notes={{pitch=note}}},port.keys,settings.octave,false)[note]
        if not p then player:notify("Esta nota no existe en el mapa del piano");return end
        local count=0
        for _ in pairs(self.manualCounts) do count+=1 end
        if not self.manualCounts[p] and count>=port.voices then return end
        if not self.manualCounts[p] then
            local ok,e=pcall(port.on,p,0.72)
            if not ok then player:notify("Error al tocar · "..tostring(e));return end
        end
        self.manual[key]=p;self.manualCounts[p]=(self.manualCounts[p] or 0)+1
        self.manualRevision+=1;draw()
    end
    player.beforePlay=function() app:releaseAll() end
    function app:selectPort(port)
        if player.port~=port then self:releaseAll();player:setPort(port) end
    end
    function app:cyclePort()
        if #self.choices==0 then return end
        local index=table.find(self.choices,player.port) or 0
        local port=self.choices[index%#self.choices+1]
        self.pinned=true;self.lost=false;self:selectPort(port)
        player:notify(port.name.." · "..(if port.ready then "Listo" else port.reason))
    end
    function app:portsChanged(items)
        table.clear(self.choices)
        for _,port in ipairs(items) do table.insert(self.choices,port) end
        table.insert(self.choices,self.demo)
        local old=player.port
        if old and old.root then
            local replacement
            for _,p in ipairs(items) do if p.root==old.root then replacement=p;break end end
            self:selectPort(replacement)
            if not replacement then self.lost=true;player:notify("Piano desconectado. Elige otro en Pianos") end
        elseif not self.lost and not self.pinned and scheduler.state~="playing" then
            local pick=items[1] or self.demo
            for _,p in ipairs(items) do if p.ready then pick=p;break end end
            self:selectPort(pick)
        end
        if self.ui then self.ui.refresh() end
    end
    function app:destroy(guiDestroying)
        if not self.alive then return end
        self.alive=false
        disconnect(self.links)
        if self.importLink then self.importLink:Disconnect() end
        self:releaseAll();scheduler:stop()
        if self.detector then self.detector:destroy() end
        if self.demo then self.demo.destroy() end
        player.changed=nil
        if self.ui then self.ui.destroy(guiDestroying) elseif not guiDestroying then gui:Destroy() end
    end
    table.insert(app.links,script.Destroying:Connect(function() app:destroy() end))
    table.insert(app.links,gui.Destroying:Connect(function() app:destroy(true) end))
    local ok,err=pcall(function()
        if script:GetAttribute("RunPianoTests")==true then print("REYZN PIANO · "..SelfTest.run(library).." · "..SelfTest.adapters()) end
        if not app.alive then return end
        local sample=tostring(script:GetAttribute("PianoSampleId") or "78413131279275")
        if sample:match("^%d+$") then sample="rbxassetid://"..sample end
        local rootNote=noteNumber(script:GetAttribute("PianoSampleRoot")) or 60
        app.demo=DemoPiano.new(game:GetService("SoundService"),sample,rootNote,function() if app.alive and app.ui then app.ui.refresh() end end)
        app.detector=PianoDetector.new(game:GetService("CollectionService"),workspace,playerGui,function(items) app:portsChanged(items) end)
        app.ui=InterfaceController.new(app,gui)
        player.changed=function(message) if app.alive then app.ui.refresh(message) end end
        local seen=setmetatable({},{__mode="k"})
        local importFolder
        local function importOne(entry)
            if seen[entry] or not entry:IsA("Folder") then return end
            seen[entry]=true
            task.defer(function()
                if not app.alive or not entry.Parent or entry:GetAttribute("ReyznMIDI")~=true then return end
                local valid,problem=pcall(function()
                    local count=entry:GetAttribute("BlockCount") or #entry:GetChildren()
                    assert(whole(count,1,171),"Número de bloques MIDI inválido")
                    local parts={}
                    local deadline=os.clock()+10
                    for i=1,count do
                        local name=string.format("%04d",i)
                        local block=entry:FindFirstChild(name) or entry:WaitForChild(name,math.max(0,deadline-os.clock()))
                        if not app.alive then return end
                        assert(block and block:IsA("StringValue") and #block.Value<=8192,"Bloque MIDI incompleto")
                        parts[i]=block.Value
                    end
                    library:import(entry.Name,decode64(encoding,table.concat(parts)))
                end)
                if not valid then warn("REYZN PIANO · "..entry.Name.." · "..tostring(problem)) end
                if app.alive then app.ui.libraryChanged() end
            end)
        end
        local function watchImports(folder)
            if folder.Name~="ReyznPianoMIDI" or not folder:IsA("Folder") or folder==importFolder then return end
            if app.importLink then app.importLink:Disconnect() end
            importFolder=folder
            app.importLink=folder.ChildAdded:Connect(importOne)
            local entries=folder:GetChildren()
            table.sort(entries,function(a,b) return a.Name<b.Name end)
            for _,entry in ipairs(entries) do importOne(entry) end
        end
        table.insert(app.links,storage.ChildAdded:Connect(watchImports))
        table.insert(app.links,storage.ChildRemoved:Connect(function(item)
            if item==importFolder then
                app.importLink:Disconnect();app.importLink=nil;importFolder=nil
            end
        end))
        local folder=storage:FindFirstChild("ReyznPianoMIDI")
        if folder then watchImports(folder) end
    end)
    if not ok then app:destroy();warn("REYZN PIANO · "..tostring(err)) end
end

